<title>USA: Tandy Corp Feb same-store sales fall 1 pct.</title>
<headline>Tandy Corp Feb same-store sales fall 1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>FORT WORTH, Texas 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Percent change</p>
<p>		    1997	 1996	     Total     Same-Store</p>
<p>Month	     $367.8     $335.5     +6.0	 -1.0</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures in millions except percentage.</p>
<p>    Month is   four weeks ended	  Feb 28.</p>
<p>Tandy reports on calendar-month basis. February 1996 was a leap year, so was one day longer than 1997 period. Excluding the 29th day in 1996 figures, total increase in February 1997 was 10.0 percent, with a gain of 3 percent for same-store sales.</p>
</text>
